SCOPE NOTE (no scope narrowing — covenant #2)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The manifest record for this page extracted 0 panels / 0 charts because the web page file delegates
its body to sub-components imported from ../components/weekly-digest (WeekSelector, SummaryHeroCards,
DrivingSection, ChargingSection, BatteryHealthSection, AlertsSection, WeekOverWeekSummary). Those are
SEPARATE feature-view parity units (p4-apple/feature-views/P-0071/0072/0075/0077/0078/0079); they are
stateful, self-managed surfaces. Rather than ship only the 8 formal page items, the FULL web page
composition is reproduced region-for-region as a self-contained page (the established AnalyticsPage
precedent), in the same data + grouping + order:
  • header: PageContainer title + subtitle + the vehicle Select action;
  • 3 page states: loading→DigestSkeleton, !hasData→EmptyState, error→PageContainer error + Retry;
  • WeekSelector (prev / label+Current badge / next-disabled-on-current);
  • SummaryHeroCards: 5 hero cards + optional Fun Fact, each with a web-over-week trend chip;
  • DrivingSection: daily-distance bar chart + 4 stat tiles + top-drive card (with its own empty);
  • ChargingSection: daily-energy bar chart + 4 stat tiles + energy-vs-last-week delta;
  • BatteryHealthSection: 2 battery pills + 3 stat tiles;
  • AlertsSection: total badge, empty state, severity rows + alert-distribution donut;
  • WeekOverWeekSummary: 6 stat cards.
Charts use the P3 native Swift Charts wrappers (TSChartContainer / TSBarChart / TSPieChart) — never a
WKWebView. 2,192 Swift source lines reproduce the 783-line web page + component set.

AI narration: the web page's trailing <AIDigestNarration> is wrapped by withAiFeature('digest-
narration', …) and renders as a no-op when ai_mode='off' OR the per-feature toggle is off (ADR-015).
The deterministic template digest above is the canonical baseline for every user; AI narration is a
separate feature unit. Omitting it preserves the canonical default-off baseline (no scope narrowing
of the parity unit, which is the deterministic digest).

