NAVIGATION NOTE (no predecessor bypass — covenant #7)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The web route /weekly-digest is a real route (web/src/App.tsx line 511) linked from the Fleet
Analytics quick links (AnalyticsPage.Overview.swift `path: "/weekly-digest"`), but had no AppRoute
case — so the link + deep link did not resolve. A new `.weeklyDigest` AppRoute case is added with
pathSegment "weekly-digest" (AppRouteParser auto-resolves it — no alias needed), systemImage
"calendar", and group .insights (alongside .analytics). RouteTests stay green: they assert unique
pathSegments + group resolution + parser behavior, not a fixed case set; the new case has a unique
segment and is added to the (compiler-exhaustive) group switch. WeeklyDigestRouteRegistration registers
.weeklyDigest → WeeklyDigestPage and is composed into TeslaSyncApp.buildRouteRegistry() after
MileageRouteRegistration. No existing case/alias was removed.

